{
  "description": "Internal refurbishment works of existing domestic 2 storey maisonette. Replacement surface finishes and sanitaryware in en-suite and bathroom. Formation of new cloakroom with new timber partition wall. Addition of wall panelling details. Addition of suspended coffer ceiling in living room. Replacement and new mouldings to ceilings. Replacement floor finishes installed over existing modern 18mm thick floorboards. Replacement kitchen units with new units, worktop, electrics to form utility room. Install new kitchen in living room.  Replacement and new built in wardrobes and furniture. Addition of new drainage runs between existing floor joists with core drills through masonry walls for new pipes. Core drill holes through external wall for new extractor fan outlets. New electrical wiring and outlets. Replacement and new radiators. Repaint all retained wall and ceiling finishes. Removal of fan lights ",
